cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "research-ledger — timestamped record of the commit history of HistorEE_codebooks and myfoamrepo"
message: "If you rely on this ledger, please cite it using these metadata."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Schiltz
    given-names: Michael
    affiliation: Hokkaido University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9776-7918"
abstract: "One hash-chained entry for every pushed branch head of two public research repositories, each with an OpenTimestamps proof tying it to a Bitcoin block. The ledger dates the pushed history of both repositories independently of GitHub and of the author."
repository-code: "https://github.com/michaelschiltz/research-ledger"
